WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.800
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.880 --> 01:40.800
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:23.640 --> 02:25.120
I never loved you.

02:27.120 --> 02:28.160
I don't believe that.

02:30.280 --> 02:31.520
I don't believe you!

02:34.280 --> 02:36.280
If you really lied to me,

02:36.360 --> 02:38.880
why are you telling me this now?

02:39.440 --> 02:41.520
You could have continued to lie to me

02:41.600 --> 02:43.200
and let me know nothing.

02:47.520 --> 02:48.520
I coaxed you

02:49.280 --> 02:50.680
and made promises to you

02:51.480 --> 02:53.760
because you were still useful.

02:54.600 --> 02:55.680
But now,

02:55.760 --> 02:57.960
I have a better option.

02:59.480 --> 03:01.920
So regardless if
it's the primordial spirit of Lady Chidi

03:02.560 --> 03:03.640
or you,

03:04.520 --> 03:06.000
they are already useless to me.

03:23.480 --> 03:24.680
Keep an eye on her.

03:25.840 --> 03:27.640
Make sure nothing goes wrong again.

03:29.400 --> 03:30.240
Yes.

03:39.760 --> 03:42.200
So you deliberately let Changheng
take her away.

03:44.000 --> 03:45.240
Why did you do that?

03:46.480 --> 03:47.760
Aren't I stupid?

03:49.760 --> 03:52.640
Changheng will surely take her to Xishan
to find her identity.

03:53.760 --> 03:57.400
Besides, I am the one
who slaughtered the Xilan Tribe.

03:59.000 --> 04:01.120
No matter how kind and benevolent she is,

04:02.200 --> 04:05.360
her parents and family
are part of the Xilan Tribe after all.

04:05.440 --> 04:07.480
She'll hate me
for slaughtering her people,

04:08.880 --> 04:11.200
so her love for me will be shaken

04:12.720 --> 04:14.200
and the Bone Orchid can be broken.

04:16.600 --> 04:18.040
Making her lose her love for me

04:19.920 --> 04:22.160
is the only way to save her life.

04:32.080 --> 04:32.920
My lord,

04:33.000 --> 04:34.920
the Fairy Realm's army
is about to reach Xuanxu Realm.

04:44.440 --> 04:46.480
Then let them all die here.

05:22.600 --> 05:23.840
You made my brother suffer

05:23.920 --> 05:25.680
and yet you can only cry here?

05:26.440 --> 05:27.600
Where's the courage you had before?

05:28.160 --> 05:29.120
What about your arrogance?

05:29.880 --> 05:31.920
If you didn't let
his root of emotion recover,

05:32.000 --> 05:34.360
making him lose Hellfire,
he wouldn't have ended up like this!

05:40.400 --> 05:41.920
Do you know what evil qi is?

05:43.840 --> 05:46.160
Do you know how dangerous and scary it is?

05:47.440 --> 05:48.520
Once he gets attacked,

05:49.440 --> 05:51.320
his primordial spirit
will gradually be corroded.

05:52.400 --> 05:54.920
Only a walking corpse will be left behind.

05:55.960 --> 05:57.040
Where's the Chengying Sword?

05:58.200 --> 05:59.160
What do you want to do?

05:59.720 --> 06:01.280
Take me to Xuanxu Realm.

06:07.200 --> 06:12.160
AN ANCIENT BATTLEFIELD, XUANXU REALM

07:48.280 --> 07:50.640
As long as I kill myself
with the Chengying Sword,

07:52.920 --> 07:55.440
can 100,000 Moon Tribe soldiers come home?

07:56.760 --> 07:57.600
Yes.

07:58.760 --> 07:59.760
As long as I die,

08:04.160 --> 08:05.960
will he really be safe?

08:07.120 --> 08:08.200
Yes.

09:46.840 --> 09:48.400
Do you see it?

09:48.920 --> 09:52.200
These are the 200,000 elite soldiers
of Shuiyuntian.

09:52.280 --> 09:54.520
Even with your women and children
on the battlefield,

09:54.600 --> 09:57.200
you only have 80,000.

09:57.280 --> 09:59.760
It's no different
than courting your own ruin.

10:00.880 --> 10:03.400
This is a survival battle
for the Moon Tribe.

10:03.480 --> 10:05.120
Dongfang Qingcang,

10:05.200 --> 10:07.400
are you still unwilling to face it?

10:07.480 --> 10:09.560
I'm the only one who can change

10:09.640 --> 10:11.320
all of this.

10:11.400 --> 10:12.280
Who

10:14.240 --> 10:15.280
exactly are you?

10:17.200 --> 10:19.280
Isn't it too late

10:19.360 --> 10:20.440
for you to ask that?

10:20.520 --> 10:21.360
Yes.

10:22.640 --> 10:23.600
It's too late.

10:26.280 --> 10:28.080
I have no other choice.

10:29.280 --> 10:31.080
I can tell you.

10:32.040 --> 10:33.680
I'm the Evil God Taisui.

10:34.280 --> 10:38.000
The oldest and strongest god
in the three realms.

10:38.080 --> 10:40.200
I can release
the 100,000 elite soldiers for you

10:40.280 --> 10:41.720
and make them invincible.

10:42.280 --> 10:43.120
You

10:43.600 --> 10:45.440
know what to do.

11:05.440 --> 11:07.120
Moon Supreme, I'm incompetent.

11:07.680 --> 11:09.040
I can't release

11:09.120 --> 11:10.160
the 100,000 soldiers.

11:10.920 --> 11:11.760
It's fine.

11:12.400 --> 11:13.760
I have a way to do that.

11:19.400 --> 11:20.560
Moon Supreme.

11:21.360 --> 11:23.560
Leave the 100,000 soldiers to me.

11:27.640 --> 11:28.480
Xunfeng,

11:29.040 --> 11:30.160
I'll leave this place to you.

11:31.800 --> 11:33.000
Yes.

12:02.280 --> 12:03.440
Lord of Haishi,

12:05.400 --> 12:06.440
what do you want?

14:40.920 --> 14:41.760
Orchid.

14:53.560 --> 14:54.760
You can't die yet.

14:55.320 --> 14:56.760
You are too important to me.

14:57.640 --> 14:58.560
Thirty thousand years.

14:59.120 --> 15:01.000
I've been looking for you
for 30,000 years.

15:02.040 --> 15:04.240
I've searched every corner
in the three realms.

15:06.880 --> 15:07.920
I've waited too long

15:09.040 --> 15:10.680
for this moment.

17:14.359 --> 17:15.599
Orchid!

17:28.560 --> 17:29.440
No.

17:30.040 --> 17:31.640
I can't die like this.

17:32.800 --> 17:34.680
I can only be killed
by the Chengying Sword.

17:35.480 --> 17:37.160
This way, he can survive.

17:38.000 --> 17:40.280
Everyone will be able to survive.

17:48.120 --> 17:50.040
Orchid!

17:55.840 --> 17:57.640
Orchid!

18:11.640 --> 18:12.480
Qingchuan!

20:25.680 --> 20:27.080
You could have made this right.

20:28.520 --> 20:29.520
Why do you insist

20:30.120 --> 20:31.560
on putting us in such a situation?

20:31.640 --> 20:33.120
Do I have a choice?

20:35.880 --> 20:37.080
How can I choose?

20:38.600 --> 20:39.760
Who cares?

20:46.680 --> 20:47.520
I do.

20:51.800 --> 20:52.640
Changheng.

20:55.200 --> 20:56.800
You are the only friend I have left

20:58.560 --> 21:00.200
in this world.

21:05.280 --> 21:06.120
No.

21:08.560 --> 21:09.400
Ronghao,

21:10.440 --> 21:11.680
from now on,

21:12.920 --> 21:13.800
we

21:15.200 --> 21:16.080
are no longer friends.

22:54.360 --> 22:55.360
Orchid.

23:51.680 --> 23:53.200
This person is so strange.

23:53.280 --> 23:55.840
His wife is a villain.

23:55.920 --> 23:57.240
And she always bullies him.

23:57.320 --> 24:00.000
Why does he still want to be with her,

24:00.080 --> 24:02.320
be nice to her, protect her,

24:02.400 --> 24:04.600
and continue
to love her this way until the very end?

24:05.640 --> 24:07.040
Orchid,

24:07.120 --> 24:08.160
you don't understand.

24:09.000 --> 24:10.200
There's no reason in love.

24:11.040 --> 24:12.280
Whether one is good

24:12.960 --> 24:13.800
or evil,

24:14.280 --> 24:16.200
whether he's an immortal or a human,

24:16.280 --> 24:17.280
if you fall for him,

24:18.000 --> 24:19.120
you just love him.

24:21.080 --> 24:22.320
I don't understand.

24:22.400 --> 24:24.720
Could this be fate?

24:26.280 --> 24:27.760
It's not fate.

24:28.880 --> 24:30.400
Everything in this world is fated.

24:32.800 --> 24:34.200
Only love

24:35.560 --> 24:36.400
is not fate.

25:02.680 --> 25:03.680
Orchid.

25:06.640 --> 25:07.640
Orchid.

25:10.960 --> 25:11.960
Orchid.

25:24.520 --> 25:25.560
Orchid!

26:11.640 --> 26:12.480
Orchid!

26:14.640 --> 26:16.160
No!

28:18.600 --> 28:19.760
Orchid.

29:19.680 --> 29:20.560
Orchid.

29:24.440 --> 29:25.280
Orchid.

29:28.120 --> 29:28.960
Orchid.

29:46.680 --> 29:47.720
No.

29:48.520 --> 29:49.360
No.

30:03.920 --> 30:04.840
This is great.

30:07.200 --> 30:08.200
You're fine.

30:22.520 --> 30:23.680
I want

30:26.400 --> 30:27.440
to get some sun.

30:31.280 --> 30:32.120
All right.

32:26.680 --> 32:27.640
Don't cry.

32:35.960 --> 32:36.920
Smile.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.360
Big Blockhead.

32:57.440 --> 32:58.680
You're so annoying.

33:02.800 --> 33:04.240
But I still like you.

34:50.480 --> 34:52.639
The 100,000 soldiers were released
and returned home.

34:52.719 --> 34:54.719
Both tribes also agreed
to a truce for 100 years.

34:55.880 --> 34:58.920
All villages and tribes are cheering
at Cangyan Sea now.

35:04.360 --> 35:05.200
Since you're awake,

35:05.280 --> 35:06.480
I should go too.

35:13.000 --> 35:14.080
Where are you going, Jieli?

35:14.160 --> 35:15.720
Why did you work for the Lord of Haishi?

35:15.800 --> 35:17.320
They forced you, right?

35:17.400 --> 35:18.600
No one forced me.

35:19.160 --> 35:20.040
That's impossible.

35:20.680 --> 35:22.440
You and Fairy Orchid are best friends.

35:23.240 --> 35:24.240
If no one forced you,

35:24.840 --> 35:27.360
- why would you try to harm her?
- Because all those were fake.

35:28.680 --> 35:29.640
Fake?

35:31.360 --> 35:32.480
I don't understand.

35:32.560 --> 35:34.440
What else do you not understand?

35:35.440 --> 35:37.520
I've been loyal to Haishi
since the beginning.

35:38.080 --> 35:40.160
I sneaked into Silent Moon Palace
to gain your trust.

35:40.240 --> 35:42.600
That was what I was told to do.

35:43.160 --> 35:44.040
That's impossible.

35:46.000 --> 35:47.320
You must be lying again, right?

35:47.800 --> 35:48.920
I'm not lying.

35:51.880 --> 35:52.720
Jieli,

35:53.680 --> 35:54.680
every time you lie to me,

35:54.760 --> 35:56.000
you look serious.

35:56.840 --> 35:58.160
I won't believe you this time.

35:58.880 --> 36:00.560
Come on, come back with me.

36:00.640 --> 36:02.800
- Even if there's a misunderstanding--
- Let go of me.

36:08.040 --> 36:09.280
Stupid Black Dragon.

36:09.760 --> 36:11.600
How long are you going to be this stupid?

36:11.680 --> 36:14.400
People like me
would never treat anyone sincerely!

36:14.480 --> 36:15.880
Didn't I tell you?

36:15.960 --> 36:17.280
I have no heart.

36:17.360 --> 36:18.560
I can lie to anyone.

36:18.640 --> 36:19.920
I can say anything.

36:20.480 --> 36:22.080
Best friends who share weal and woe?

36:22.160 --> 36:24.000
I lied to you all.

36:24.080 --> 36:25.040
All of those were fake.

36:25.120 --> 36:26.480
Don't you understand?

36:30.240 --> 36:31.080
What about me?

36:34.280 --> 36:35.760
Did you lie

36:40.040 --> 36:40.960
about marrying me too?

36:41.480 --> 36:42.680
Of course.

36:44.000 --> 36:44.880
I got close to you

36:44.960 --> 36:46.160
and promised to marry you

36:46.240 --> 36:48.880
to use you to get close to Moon Supreme.

36:48.960 --> 36:50.680
Now that my mission is accomplished,

36:51.840 --> 36:53.320
I don't have to lie to you anymore.

37:09.680 --> 37:10.520
Do you hate me?

37:13.480 --> 37:14.320
Fine.

37:15.840 --> 37:16.840
Kill me then.

37:21.080 --> 37:22.000
You can't do it?

37:25.800 --> 37:26.680
Stupid Black Dragon.

37:29.200 --> 37:30.080
Forget about me.

37:36.680 --> 37:37.520
I'll get going.

38:36.880 --> 38:37.720
Hao.

38:47.640 --> 38:48.520
Master, you're awake.

38:49.640 --> 38:50.640
Why don't you sleep more?

38:51.960 --> 38:53.040
How long did I sleep?

38:55.440 --> 38:56.600
About an hour.

38:56.680 --> 38:57.920
Are you still tired?

38:58.440 --> 38:59.440
An hour?

39:01.080 --> 39:03.000
Why do I feel
like I've slept for a long time?

39:04.680 --> 39:06.320
Maybe you haven't recovered yet,

39:06.800 --> 39:07.760
so you get tired easily.

39:08.840 --> 39:09.680
Why don't I

39:09.760 --> 39:12.400
take you back to your room
to have a good rest?

39:23.280 --> 39:24.600
No.

39:26.000 --> 39:27.240
I'm already dead.

39:27.320 --> 39:28.200
How could…

39:29.080 --> 39:30.520
Master, did you forget again?

39:30.600 --> 39:31.520
You didn't die

39:31.600 --> 39:32.520
in that battle.

39:34.080 --> 39:35.280
You were just seriously injured.

39:35.840 --> 39:37.040
But later on,

39:37.120 --> 39:38.720
the Goddess of Xishan cured you.

39:39.560 --> 39:40.400
Since then,

39:40.480 --> 39:41.920
your primordial spirit has been damaged,

39:42.000 --> 39:43.160
so your memory has become bad.

39:43.720 --> 39:44.840
I've told you

39:44.920 --> 39:46.080
about this

39:46.160 --> 39:47.440
seven to eight times already.

40:20.720 --> 40:22.240
You're awake?

40:29.680 --> 40:30.920
Or…

40:32.920 --> 40:33.960
Orchid.

40:37.160 --> 40:38.000
You…

40:39.000 --> 40:39.960
Aren't you…

40:40.560 --> 40:41.600
What?

41:02.880 --> 41:03.800
Big Blockhead,

41:04.320 --> 41:05.160
what's wrong?

41:06.800 --> 41:08.200
- Big Blockhead.
- Nothing.

41:10.680 --> 41:12.360
I think I had a nightmare.

41:14.680 --> 41:15.960
What nightmare?

41:20.680 --> 41:21.760
Forget about it.

41:26.400 --> 41:27.240
Big Blockhead.

41:27.720 --> 41:28.960
You're hurting me.

41:30.280 --> 41:31.120
Big Blockhead.

41:31.680 --> 41:32.920
Let me hug you.

43:55.600 --> 43:57.280
I'm almost done.

44:08.280 --> 44:09.120
Big Blockhead.

44:09.200 --> 44:10.800
We've been married for 500 years.

44:10.880 --> 44:12.320
How can you still not draw them well?

44:13.000 --> 44:13.920
You're so stupid.

44:14.880 --> 44:15.960
Are they not pretty?
